OL,4,G1600FHuw Stephens
OL,5,     GIt's Friday, so Huw is out to
OL,6,     Gprove that any song sounds better
OL,7,     Gwhen it's played on 6 Music by
OL,8,     GHuw Stephens - so let us know
OL,9,     Gwhat you want to hear.
OL,10,G1900FThe People's Party with Femi
OL,11,     FKoleoso
OL,12,     GAs this year's carnival kicks off
OL,13,     Gin Brazil, Femi joins in on the
OL,14,     Gfun, spinning the sounds of deep
OL,15,     Gsamba to baile funk to Brazilian
OL,16,     GR&B. Also, Nubya Garcia shares
OL,17,     Gher Friday Vibe.
